flowchart TD
    LC["LazyColumn + collectAsLazyPagingItems"]
    PAGER["Pager(PagingConfig)"]
    PS["PagingSource = Room DAO"]
    ROOM["Room (cached pages)"]
    RM["RemoteMediator"]
    API["Paged API (cursor/offset)"]
    BK["Backend"]
    PAGER -->|Flow of PagingData| LC
    LC -.-> PAGER
    PAGER --> PS
    PAGER --> RM
    PS --> ROOM
    RM -->|write page + remote keys| ROOM
    ROOM -.->|invalidate, new PagingData| PAGER
    RM -->|Room exhausted| API
    API --> BK
    BK --> RM
